{"code":"318410","name":"비비씨","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"가정용품","sector_desc":"생활용품·위생용품. 경기 방어적인 필수소비재입니다.","desc":"동사는 2008년 설립되어 엔지니어링 플라스틱 선, 봉, 관 및 호스의 연구, 제조, 판매를 주요 사업으로 영위하며, 2020년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 사업부문은 모노필라멘트 소재사업, 칫솔 등 생활용품 헬스케어 사업, 패션잡화 사업으로 구성되어 있음. 소재사업은 PBT 모노필라멘트 기술로 덴탈케어, 뷰티케어, 산업용 브러쉬 소재를 공급하고, 헬스케어와 패션잡화는 자체 브랜드를 홈쇼핑과 온라인으로 판매하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":5860.0,"open":5740.0,"high":5870.0,"low":5740.0,"volume":4471,"amount":26200060.0,"ret_1d":2.2688,"gap":0.1745,"range_pct":2.2184,"ret_5":-1.5126,"ret_20":-9.0062,"ret_60":7.1298,"ret_120":-22.8947,"ret_250":-36.0262,"ma20":6083.5,"ma60":6231.8333,"ma120":6272.3333,"ma200":6721.25,"close_vs_ma200":-12.8138,"close_vs_ma60":-5.9667,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.2017,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":-17.459,"r2_120":0.1046,"slope_250":-30.9993,"r2_250":0.7327,"high52":9150.0,"low52":5090.0,"pos_52w":18.9655,"dd_52w":-35.9563,"mdd_1y":-41.9248,"atr14_pct":3.8944,"vol_ann_60":29.2493,"vol_avg20":6999.5,"vol_ratio20":0.6388,"vr5":1.2491,"vr20":0.5725,"amount_avg5":53962322.0,"amount_avg20":42161193.5,"amount_avg60":47452282.3333,"obv_chg20":-24.1689,"turnover_20":2.52,"pv_eff_20":-3.5739,"rsi14":38.8534,"frgn_net_5":2794.0,"inst_net_5":350.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0503,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0063,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0566,"frgn_net_20":1447.0,"inst_net_20":-1562.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.026,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0281,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0021,"frgn_net_60":7839.0,"inst_net_60":-442.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1411,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.008,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1332,"frgn_net_120":55764.0,"inst_net_120":-86413.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":1.0038,"inst_net_120_pct":-1.5555,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.5517,"foreign_ratio":2.48,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.07,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":38.0,"op_margin_q":24.8366,"op_qoq":80.9524,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":100.0,"rev_yoy":28.5714,"op_trend_4q":61.4085,"fin_period":"202606","roe":12.24,"debt_ratio":16.38,"per":3.24,"pbr":0.38,"div_yield":6.83,"foreign